WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.654 --> 00:00:12.654
Eric and his parents stood outside their house.

2
00:00:12.655 --> 00:00:16.991
They were watching a parade.

3
00:00:16.992 --> 00:00:23.325
A band marched toward them.

4
00:00:23.326 --> 00:00:29.126
Eric saw lots of different instruments.

5
00:00:29.127 --> 00:00:37.388
And then—boom! Ba-boom! Rat-a-tat-tat! Drums!

6
00:00:37.389 --> 00:00:41.666
Drummers banged big drums and little drums.

7
00:00:41.667 --> 00:00:45.398
"Cool!" thought Eric.

8
00:00:45.399 --> 00:00:51.724
Days went by.

9
00:00:51.725 --> 00:00:59.563
Eric couldn't stop thinking about those drums.

10
00:00:59.564 --> 00:01:03.794
At dinner he tapped on the table.

11
00:01:03.795 --> 00:01:09.475
At school he tapped on his books.

12
00:01:09.476 --> 00:01:17.512
In the kitchen he banged pots together.

13
00:01:17.513 --> 00:01:22.714
"Let's go to the garage," Dad said one day.

14
00:01:22.715 --> 00:01:25.543
"Why?" Eric asked.

15
00:01:25.544 --> 00:01:29.017
Dad smiled.

16
00:01:29.018 --> 00:01:36.128
"I have a surprise."

17
00:01:36.129 --> 00:01:46.747
Dad took Eric into the garage.

18
00:01:46.748 --> 00:01:54.656
"A drum set!" cried Eric.

19
00:01:54.657 --> 00:01:58.408
It was Dad's old drum set.

20
00:01:58.409 --> 00:02:03.477
The set had three drums and cymbals.

21
00:02:03.478 --> 00:02:08.356
Dad gave Eric the drumsticks.

22
00:02:08.357 --> 00:02:14.503
He showed Eric how to hold them.

23
00:02:14.504 --> 00:02:16.865
Eric hit the drums fast.

24
00:02:16.866 --> 00:02:19.420
Tat! Tat! Tat!

25
00:02:19.421 --> 00:02:25.730
Eric banged the cymbals. Clash!

26
00:02:25.731 --> 00:02:29.801
"I hear music!" someone said.

27
00:02:29.802 --> 00:02:33.540
Eric looked up and saw Mom.

28
00:02:33.541 --> 00:02:37.463
She had her guitar.

29
00:02:37.464 --> 00:02:41.549
Dad held up his harmonica.

30
00:02:41.550 --> 00:02:48.723
Eric grinned. "We've got a family band.

31
00:02:48.724 --> 00:03:06.710
Let's play!"
